{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"s6a77b1114563a686","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7469-a3d28e35ac132c6d7fc3","text":"所以你的课上得怎么样了？","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-7a9bc78b622681deca9e","text":"有什么好玩的吗，快分享一下","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-6c4a8cf6a6b34b167e0d","text":"财富学院的课…","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-4da4690e133f2313df09","text":"财富学院的课上，遇到了个专门替人签到的皮皮西","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-790aee2b219719f5d455","text":"…就是卖我签名照那家伙","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-e0e738846c68ab62d658","text":"他还搞了个「服务套餐」，要价特别离谱","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-ada52aed3c5f80f8dc71","text":"这就是所谓的商业头脑吧","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-8169fdd9e47ff0709cbd","text":"筑梦学院的课…","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-f6f84308d21ee867fef3","text":"筑梦学院的课上，旁边的学生在画钟表小子同人漫画","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-20df86b509b7127cc65e","text":"那画功简直了，剧情也特别好","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-64235e6948af31683be7","text":"你是去上课还是去逛展的啊！","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-11d9eb4b7800bc673e97","text":"谐乐学院的课…","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-f29357addbb8e8666843","text":"谐乐学院的课可有意思了，满教室都是玩角色扮演的！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-3d8843670409d15ac994","text":"我的同桌是只折纸小鸟","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-f1514541486c779d799f","text":"还真是自由啊……","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-4acf19d88a74be2c49d8","text":"听你讲完，我也想去上课了","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-5818df2baf4479890d28","text":"这就去翻课程表！","speaker":"三月七"}]}
